graph TB
    subgraph Containers
        A1[App 1] --> C1[Container Runtime]
        A2[App 2] --> C1
        C1 --> H1[Host OS]
        H1 --> HW1[Hardware]
    end
    
    subgraph VMs
        A3[App 3] --> G1[Guest OS 1]
        A4[App 4] --> G2[Guest OS 2]
        G1 & G2 --> HV[Hypervisor]
        HV --> H2[Host OS]
        H2 --> HW2[Hardware]
    end